{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal:\u00a0</strong>survive in the arena as long as possible fighting against <strong>Time</strong>. The longer you survive the harder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/9e3c089321cc8c42b35758d1bffb730d.poster.avif?t=1756586577\" width=1232 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/9e3c089321cc8c42b35758d1bffb730d.webm?t=1756586577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Survivor is an action arena incremental, where you have to survive while your life energy increasingly decays over time. If you die you can start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stay alive you have to collect <strong>Energy Orbs</strong>\u00a0that restore your energy\u00a0while <strong>dodging</strong> and <strong>killing enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/8e57865b43f437f925d9e6e456da67e3.poster.avif?t=1756586577\" width=1232 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/8e57865b43f437f925d9e6e456da67e3.webm?t=1756586577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you die, you can use the collected resources to\u00a0<strong>buy upgrades</strong>\u00a0in the <strong>Skill Tree\u00a0</strong>to increase your stats and unlock new skills, making you stronger for the next trial!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The upgrade tree has four main branches:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECONOMY</strong>: Upgrades that enhance the farming aspect of the game, such as increasing the value of resources you collect or the number of drops from enemies.  <br>But be careful\u2014these upgrades also buff the enemies! Don't be too greedy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOVEMENT</strong>: Upgrades that increase your speed and improve your movement around the map, fundamental for dodging enemies and reaching resources faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENERGY</strong>: Upgrades that increase your life energy, give you armor, enhance the energy recovered from energy orbs, and so on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong>: Upgrades that expand your offensive arsenal, giving you the option to fight back and effectively become a predator instead of prey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/000b25a6c7ca1ba7816d541593e77004.poster.avif?t=1756586577\" width=1232 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/000b25a6c7ca1ba7816d541593e77004.webm?t=1756586577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From\u00a0<strong>\u00a0prey</strong> to<strong> predator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the core mechanics of the game is the<strong> Dash</strong>\u00a0that you can buy in the skill tree and that you can upgrade during a run. You can damage enemies to kill them and obtain new resources to power up even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/1495971001fb74ad755e697abaf40f6c.poster.avif?t=1756586577\" width=1232 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/1495971001fb74ad755e697abaf40f6c.webm?t=1756586577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you reach a new minute mark, a new\u00a0challenging<strong> boss</strong>\u00a0appears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to kill them all?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653480?t=1756586577","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653480?t=1756586577","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/2c6b578d81cfec6eea79c8936bfef4ca765da763/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756586577","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/2c6b578d81cfec6eea79c8936bfef4ca765da763/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756586577","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal:\u00a0</strong>survive in the arena as long as possible fighting against <strong>Time</strong>. The longer you survive the harder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/9e3c089321cc8c42b35758d1bffb730d.poster.avif?t=1756586577\" width=1232 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653480/extras/9e3c089321cc8c42b357